{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f9caf4bb811eb078b323ed683a5a8410661d5d16cbc2f5db0cb9fcb29666c2ff", "ja": "（……ん？　レッスンルームから物音がするな。\n今の時間、この部屋を使っているのは……）", "zh": "（……嗯？练习室里好像有动静。这个时间在用这间屋子的是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8ad26f7f4440bf2acdf275347a6c5f2e6ab9d931e277b23eeec256b6b1c958e6", "ja": "お疲れ様、歩。レッスンは順調か？", "zh": "辛苦了，步。练习还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d897893ccda1f455b593e6b3b73a10e38c765152211f5be77578c4dd79835860", "ja": "{$P$}、ちょうどいいところに！\nお願いしたいことがあるんだけど、時間いい？", "zh": "{$P$}，来得正好！有件事想拜托你，现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ff19351f6fccff7718e475bb03b89cc61b75342d219588fb7c933bf4ea6cf981", "ja": "ああ、大丈夫だよ。どうした？", "zh": "啊，没问题。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3a455e6764e35207bcfefc6c8c4d2e1a2785f6612ae226e2898d47dd839c65d8", "ja": "よかった！　実はさ、サーベルタイガーになりきって\nアタシと戦ってほしいんだよ！", "zh": "太好了！其实呢，我想让你把自己当成剑齿虎，和我战斗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e3062b102f8f185b6dd8bd9b97d61600ec29edeb87f5556098d9e0928e9d9195", "ja": "はっ？　えっ？", "zh": "啊？　诶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d6d2f974a5296eb58b0552f352786c65e6867f63267d8d90d1879a73bf78b3eb", "ja": "今、『アイドルワイルドハンター』の撮影に向けて\n自主レッスンをしてたんだけど……。", "zh": "刚才我正在为《偶像荒野猎人》的拍摄进行自主练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d1094086c02dc586a8620d7632cadadb0e8940cad274065d49935772d2fe8f54", "ja": "一人だと、アクションシーンがやりづらくて。\nちょうど練習相手を探してたんだよね～！", "zh": "一个人的话，动作戏实在不太好练。\n我正好在找陪练来着～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1008_p", "source_sha256": "eba5c1bc4521277ae34a2e6aace5a056e76f1fc862ddf44ad962249f7ca82449", "ja": "な、なるほど……。サーベルタイガーになれるか\nわからないけど頑張るよ。", "zh": "原、原来如此……虽然不知道能不能变成剑齿虎，但我会努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e1c7e343c09cc5c3b65b9998a9582e19b05e957d782b1fe9f0b6ff2403e8655f", "ja": "助かるよ～！　あ、安心して、攻撃は寸止めするから。\nそれじゃ……行くよ？　おりゃー！", "zh": "帮大忙了～！啊，放心吧，我会在最后关头收住攻击的。\n那么……要上咯？喝啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dff64e4c6c26c978e62851be7fe8db4aa7ffefcd236be3dfde7bd4b1ff8ac33a", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。うん、いい感じ！\nありがと、おかげでかなりイメージが固まったよ！", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……嗯，感觉不错！\n谢谢，多亏了你，我已经基本确定好形象了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1011_p", "source_sha256": "873f3615aaaa3038df16f94964fca581f9416bf94d28d0528dff4c8150e34bae", "ja": "ぜー、ぜー……。そ、それはよかった……。", "zh": "呼、呼……那就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "db2038c666a0ddb4847ec429b9f9e13590f128498bb433cde19d88c01645f9c3", "ja": "{$P$}、大丈夫？\nゴメン、ちょっと飛ばしすぎたかな？", "zh": "{$P$}，没事吧？\n抱歉，是不是刚才跳得有点太猛了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1013_p", "source_sha256": "08043e1ef4cdec3245a6a282a71e6d44b94d09a276bc7df38801ab7e5a992961", "ja": "ふぅ……もう大丈夫だ。しかし、ビックリしたよ。\nキレがあって、凄まじい迫力だった……！", "zh": "呼……已经没事了。不过，真是吓了我一跳。\n动作利落，气势惊人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "80fe184c73f0467214656d65d5a6ad63b9eac9de428f69d853486ab54f5a817d", "ja": "ホント！？　ちょっとダンスのステップを入れてみたん\nだよね。間の取り方とか、ターンの動きとか！", "zh": "真的！？我刚才试着加了一点舞蹈步伐进去。比如节奏的把握，还有转身的动作之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "075ff9a3518598e7a055fe1eb34ceb2c9f639f052c22fc757ad83ace4f5d3d78", "ja": "難しいアクションだけど、ダンスと合わせたら、うまく\nできるかなって。効果があったみたいでよかったよ♪", "zh": "虽然是很难的动作，不过我想着要是配合舞蹈，说不定就能做好。看来确实有效，太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ac034b161106cf28ff5e69b50f7f0a6dc3ffe70be89e537024a929a2467e4abb", "ja": "そうだったのか。ははっ、歩らしい工夫だな！\nこれは本番も期待できそうだ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。哈哈，真是很有步的风格！\n看来正式演出也值得期待了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "02b41efb0dc84619a21492c3b81d9b56973124af9f980c90c223936305d4bbe0", "ja": "へへっ♪　そう言ってもらえると、\n自信をもって撮影に挑めるよ！　あ、それでね……。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 你能这么说，我就能更有自信地投入拍摄了！啊，对了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0563_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2c912135b3703f5ad835b9178392861b2c3e4a3390a8d29702c3789abd2b390f", "ja": "もう少し、練習に付き合ってもらっていい？\nこの次のシーン……ドラゴンの役も、お願いっ！", "zh": "能再陪我练习一会儿吗？\n接下来的这个场景……龙的角色也拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
